  "body": "Set in a peaceful Gulf Harbour location, this spacious corner townhouse offers an excellent opportunity for buyers looking for comfort, space and easy-care living.\r\n\r\nWith 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and approximately 138m² of living, there is plenty of room to spread out. \r\n\r\nThe well-designed layout offers flexibility for everyday living, working from home or having family and guests stay.\r\n\r\nThe home is vacant and ready to move in, making the transition simple for those looking for a property without the hassle of starting from scratch.\r\n\r\nA corner position provides additional privacy, while the internal garage and extra off-street parking add valuable convenience.\r\n\r\nThe refreshed presentation gives the home a clean, comfortable feel, while the generous living spaces make it feel larger than many comparable townhouses.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for your first home, downsizing, a lock-up-and-leave property or an investment, this is an opportunity worth seeing.\r\n\r\nPriced at $659,000.\r\n\r\nCome and see the space, position and potential for yourself.",
